        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Gao</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 700 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val">Digs at Gao-Saney show the site was occupied by roughly 700 CE, and by no later than the early 10th century the Songhay king based at Kukiya had moved to Gao Ancien.</span></div>
