          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">The kingdom of Kawkaw of the Arabic geographers; trans-Saharan trade; the Zuwa and Sonni rulers; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sunni-ali">Sunni Ali</a>'s capital of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/songhai-empire">Songhai Empire</a>; <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ibn-battuta">Ibn Battuta</a>'s visit in 1352-53; the Tomb of Askia; the medieval Arabic epitaphs of Gao-Saney</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Gao is a city in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mali">Mali</a> and the capital of the Gao Region.</span></div>
